Maintainer: hioTEC <dev@hiotec.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: dotpanel
Architecture: all
Depends: git, age, jq, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Agent memspace bootstrap and secret injection tools
 dotpanel installs two commands — dot and dkey — that wire an
 agent memspace (~/.agents) into Claude, Codex, and Kimi harnesses:
 .
  * dot manages harness entry rendering, PATH wiring, and memspace
    repo sync.
  * dkey stores encrypted environment secrets (age) and injects them
    via grant scopes or whole-environment export.
 .
 Backend switching (dkey use) writes Claude Code settings and Codex
 config from a provider registry.
